INSERT INTO `provider_models` VALUES ('pm_0316a460173b43698501','openai','llm','gpt-4.1','GPT-4.1',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'{\"streaming\": {\"help\": \"Token streaming into the sentence buffer. Always on for realtime voice.\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"fixed\": true, \"label\": \"Streaming\", \"default\": true}, \"max_tokens\": {\"max\": 4096, \"min\": 16, \"help\": \"Upper bound per reply. Voice replies should stay short.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"Max output tokens\", \"default\": 256}, \"max_retries\": {\"max\": 5, \"min\": 0, \"help\": \"Automatic retries on transient failures.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"Max retries\", \"default\": 1, \"advanced\": true}, \"temperature\": {\"max\": 2.0, \"min\": 0.0, \"help\": \"Response randomness. Keep low for voice bots.\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Temperature\", \"default\": 0.3}, \"timeout_seconds\": {\"max\": 120, \"min\": 5, \"help\": \"Per-request timeout before retry/fallback handling.\", \"step\": 1, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Timeout (s)\", \"default\": 30, \"advanced\": true}}',0,'active',3,'2026-07-31 13:07:33','2026-07-31 13:07:33',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'Full GPT-4.1: strongest of the 4.1 family for instruction following and long context. Higher cost/latency than 4.1 mini — prefer it for complex reasoning turns rather than every realtime reply.'),('pm_08ebc107cf3c42e7a86a','openai','stt','gpt-4o-mini-transcribe','GPT-4o mini Transcribe','[]','[\"linear16\"]','[8000, 16000, 24000]',0,'{}',0,'inactive',3,'2026-07-31 13:07:33','2026-07-31 13:07:33',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'Cheaper GPT-4o mini transcription (batch/REST). Inactive under platform governance: STT is Sarvam-only.'),('pm_0ab610590732','openai','llm','gpt-4.1-mini','GPT-4.1 mini','[]','null','null',1,'{\"streaming\": {\"help\": \"Token streaming into the sentence buffer. Always on for realtime voice.\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"fixed\": true, \"label\": \"Streaming\", \"default\": true}, \"max_tokens\": {\"max\": 4096, \"min\": 16, \"help\": \"Upper bound per reply. Voice replies should stay short.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"Max output tokens\", \"default\": 256}, \"max_retries\": {\"max\": 5, \"min\": 0, \"help\": \"Automatic retries on transient failures.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"Max retries\", \"default\": 1, \"advanced\": true}, \"temperature\": {\"max\": 2.0, \"min\": 0.0, \"help\": \"Response randomness. Keep low for voice bots.\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Temperature\", \"default\": 0.3}, \"timeout_seconds\": {\"max\": 120, \"min\": 5, \"help\": \"Per-request timeout before retry/fallback handling.\", \"step\": 1, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Timeout (s)\", \"default\": 30, \"advanced\": true}}',0,'active',2,'2026-07-21 18:25:14','2026-07-21 18:25:14',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),('pm_0b4471edc9544f27afa3','deepgram','stt','flux-general-multi','Flux (multilingual)','[]','[\"linear16\"]','[8000, 16000, 24000, 44100, 48000]',1,'{\"eot_threshold\": {\"max\": 0.9, \"min\": 0.5, \"help\": \"Confidence Flux needs before ending the caller\'s turn. Lower answers sooner but may cut into natural pauses.\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"End-of-turn threshold\", \"default\": 0.7}, \"eot_timeout_ms\": {\"max\": 60000, \"min\": 500, \"help\": \"Silence after speech that force-ends the turn regardless of end-of-turn confidence.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"End-of-turn timeout (ms)\", \"default\": 3000, \"advanced\": true}, \"language_hints\": {\"help\": \"Bias multilingual detection toward these languages. Defaults to the bot\'s configured languages (e.g. hi, en).\", \"type\": \"string_list\", \"label\": \"Language hints\", \"values\": [\"de\", \"en\", \"es\", \"fr\", \"hi\", \"it\", \"ja\", \"nl\", \"pt\", \"ru\"], \"advanced\": true, \"max_items\": 8, \"max_length\": 8}, \"eager_eot_threshold\": {\"max\": 0.9, \"min\": 0.3, \"help\": \"Enables EagerEndOfTurn: orchestration starts speculatively before the turn is confirmed (lower = faster responses, more speculative decision calls).\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Eager end-of-turn threshold\", \"default\": 0.6, \"advanced\": true}}',1,'active',0,'2026-08-07 05:46:16','2026-08-07 11:26:58',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'Deepgram Flux multilingual conversational STT (/v2/listen): model-integrated turn detection (EndOfTurn / EagerEndOfTurn / TurnResumed), per-turn language detection. Recommended for Hindi/Hinglish/English voice agents.'),('pm_0caa975b3d5e','openai','tts','tts-1-hd','TTS-1 HD','[]','[\"linear16\"]','[24000]',0,'{}',0,'inactive',1,'2026-07-22 15:13:21','2026-07-22 15:13:21',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL),('pm_26be960ff5af45969843','openai','llm','gpt-5.1','GPT-5.1',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'{\"streaming\": {\"help\": \"Token streaming into the sentence buffer. Always on for realtime voice.\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"fixed\": true, \"label\": \"Streaming\", \"default\": true}, \"max_tokens\": {\"max\": 4096, \"min\": 16, \"help\": \"Upper bound per reply. Voice replies should stay short.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"Max output tokens\", \"default\": 256}, \"max_retries\": {\"max\": 5, \"min\": 0, \"help\": \"Automatic retries on transient failures.\", \"type\": \"integer\", \"label\": \"Max retries\", \"default\": 1, \"advanced\": true}, \"temperature\": {\"max\": 2.0, \"min\": 0.0, \"help\": \"Response randomness. Keep low for voice bots.\", \"step\": 0.05, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Temperature\", \"default\": 0.3}, \"timeout_seconds\": {\"max\": 120, \"min\": 5, \"help\": \"Per-request timeout before retry/fallback handling.\", \"step\": 1, \"type\": \"number\", \"label\": \"Timeout (s)\", \"default\": 30, \"advanced\": true}}',0,'inactive',8,'2026-07-31 13:07:33','2026-07-31 13:07:33',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'GPT-5.1 general-purpose model. Catalogued for pricing but inactive: the OpenAI LLM provider still sends `max_tokens`/temperature, which the GPT-5 family rejects