ng the fixed prompt (rating gte-3 rule, reuse maybe handling, issue_topic hardBlocks, call-termination rule) - not changed automatically here since the platform\'s versioning is unknown.\", \"type\": \"system_prompt\", \"version\": 9}, \"workflowRef\": {\"file\": \"surveys_feedback_journey_workflow.json\", \"note\": \"UNRESOLVED - CHECK MANUALLY: this bot\'s botId is \'bot_mafil_outbound_release_fb\', but the workflow file\'s own exportedFrom.botId is \'bot_f49776262f1a\' - a mismatch. Confirm this workflow is actually the one bound to this bot before going live; if not, the fixes made to it may not apply here. Also bump version after re-import of the fixed workflow.\", \"version\": 3, \"workflowId\": \"wf_6071246e3307\"}, \"knowledgeBase\": {\"kbId\": \"kb_mafil_master\", \"note\": \"Same MAFIL KB as inbound. ALL product/service/process questions (before, during and after the survey) are answered from this KB via retrieval on every query turn.\", \"scope\": \"gold loan, online gold loan, MAkash digital wallet, forex/foreign currency, branches, documents, interest, renewal, release\", \"shared\": true, \"aliases\": {\"MAkash\": [\"makaksha\", \"maksha\", \"makash\", \"macash\", \"मकाश\"]}, \"retrieval\": \"every_query_turn\"}}, \"email\": \"gaurav@gmail.com\", \"mobile\": \"9015214225\", \"campaign\": {\"campaignId\": \"camp_recently_released_feedback\", \"compliance\": {\"dndTrapCheckRequired\": true, \"maxCallDurationSeconds\": 480, \"recordingDisclosureLine\": \"ये call quality और training purposes के लिए record की जा रही है।\", \"respectOptOutImmediately\": true, \"recordingDisclosureRequired\": true}, \"sourceList\": {\"type\": \"customer_segment\", \"segment\": \"gold_loan_recently_released\", \"description\": \"Customers whose gold loan was released/closed within the configured lookback window.\"}, \"campaignType\": \"post_service_feedback_survey\", \"dialerSettings\": {\"callingWindow\": {\"end\": \"19:00\", \"start\": \"09:00\", \"timezone\": \"Asia/Kolkata\", \"excludeSundays\": false, \"excludeNationalHolidays\": true}, \"retryGapMinutes\": 240, \"retryOnDisposition\": [\"no_answer\", \"busy\", \"call_dropped\", \"requested_callback\"], \"maxAttemptsPerCustomer\": 3, \"doNotRetryOnDisposition\": [\"wrong_number\", \"opted_out\", \"survey_completed\", \"dnd_registered\", \"negative_feedback_flagged\", \"escalated_to_agent\", \"partial_survey_query_exit\"], \"callbackPreferenceVariable\": \"callback_preference\"}, \"requiredVariables\": [\"customer_name\", \"customer_mobile\", \"loan_account_number\", \"branch_code\", \"closure_date\"], \"optionalValidationVariables\": [\"customer_address\", \"pin_code\"]}, \"webhooks\": {\"onEscalation\": {\"url\": \"https://your-crm-endpoint.example.com/mafil/outbound/escalation\", \"method\": \"POST\", \"payloadIncludes\": [\"customer_mobile\", \"loan_account_number\", \"customer_intent\", \"escalationReason\"]}, \"onCallCompleted\": {\"url\": \"https://your-crm-endpoint.example.com/mafil/outbound/feedback-complete\", \"method\": \"POST\", \"payloadIncludes\": [\"customer_mobile\", \"loan_account_number\", \"service_rating\", \"closure_experience_sentiment\", \"experience_issue_detail\", \"rating_low_reason\", \"reuse_intent\", \"reuse_decline_reason\", \"closure_experience\", \"suggestions\", \"dispositionCode\", \"callDurationSeconds\", \"transcriptRef\"]}, \"onNegativeFeedback\": {\"url\": \"https://your-crm-endpoint.example.com/mafil/outbound/negative-feedback\", \"method\": \"POST\", \"payloadIncludes\": [\"customer_mobile\", \"loan_account_number\", \"branch_code\", \"closure_experience_sentiment\", \"experience_issue_detail\", \"service_rating\", \"rating_low_reason\", \"reuse_decline_reason\"], \"triggerCondition\": \"closure_experience_sentiment == negative OR (service_rating != null AND service_rating <= 2) OR reuse_intent == \\\"no\\\"\"}}, \"branch_code\": \"TEST_BR_001\", \"closure_date\": \"2026-09-15\", \"customer_name\": \"gaurav\", \"customer_mobile\": \"9015214225\", \"variablesSchema\": {\"pin_code\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"source\": \"crm\", \"optional\": true}, \"kb_answer\": {\"type\": \"text\", \"source\": \"generated\", \"optional\": true}, \"branch_code\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"source\": \"crm\"}, \"issue_topic\": {\"note\": \"Short 2-4 word Hindi/Hinglish label of the reported issue (e.g. \'staff ke behavior\', \'waiting time\', \'charges\'). Set together with experience_issue_detail. Used inside the confirmation questions at the rating and reuse steps.\", \"type\": \"text\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"optional\": true, \"capturedAt\": \"n_experience_issue\"}, \"suggestions\": {\"type\": \"text\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"optional\": true, \"capturedAt\": \"n_suggestions\"}, \"closure_date\": {\"type\": \"date\", \"source\": \"crm\"}, \"reuse_intent\": {\"note\": \"Stored as text: \'yes\' / \'no\' / \'maybe\' (an undecided/neutral answer like \'abhi idea nahi, future mein dekhunga\' is \'maybe\', NOT \'no\'). This was previously typed boolean, which no longer matches the workflow\'s n_reuse entity (dataType text with a yes/no/maybe routing rule) - downstream comparisons must check the string value, e.g. reuse_intent == \\\"no\\\", not reuse_intent == false.\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"values\": [\"yes\", \"no\", \"maybe\"], \"capturedAt\": \"n_reuse\"}, \"customer_name\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"source\": \"crm\"}, \"service_rating\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"range\": [0, 5], \"source\": \"runtime\", \"capturedAt\": \"n_rating\"}, \"customer_intent\": {\"type\": \"text\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"optional\": true, \"capturedAt\": \"n_query_intent\"}, \"customer_mobile\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"source\": \"crm\"}, \"customer_address\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"source\": \"crm\", \"optional\": true}, \"escalationReason\": {\"type\": \"text\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"mapsFrom\": \"customer_intent\", \"optional\": true}, \"rating_low_reason\": {\"note\": \"If issue_already_reported == true the open-ended reason question is NEVER asked; instead ONE confirmation (\'kya wahi {issue_topic} wali baat is rating ki wajah hai, ya kuch aur?\') - only AFTER service_rating <= 2 is captured is asked. Confirmed -> prefilled from experience_issue_detail; a different reason named -> that reason is stored. Open-ended question only when no issue was reported earlier.\", \"type\": \"text\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"optional\": true, \"capturedAt\": \"n_rating_low_reason\"}, \"call_end_requested\": {\"note\": \"True only when the customer explicitly asked to end the call -- distinct from any negative survey answer.\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"optional\": true, \"capturedAt\": \"n_call_end_request\"}, \"closure_experience\": {\"type\": \"text\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"capturedAt\": \"n_experience\"}, \"identity_confirmed\": {\"type\": \"enum\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"values\": [\"confirmed\", \"wrong_number\", \"bad_time\", \"declined_recording\"], \"capturedAt\": \"n_identity_check\"}, \"wants_further_help\": {\"type\": \"boolean\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"optional\": true, \"capturedAt\": \"n_further_assistance\"}, \"callback_preference\": {\"type\": \"text\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"optional\": true, \"capturedAt\": \"n_reschedule\"}, \"loan_account_number\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"source\": \"crm\"}, \"reuse_decline_reason\": {\"note\": \"If issue_already_reported == true the open-ended reason question is NEVER asked; instead ONE confirmation (\'kya wahi {issue_topic} wali baat services dobara use na karne ki wajah hai, ya kuch aur?\') - only AFTER reuse_intent == false is captured is asked. Confirmed -> prefilled from experience_issue_detail; a different reason named -> that reason is stored. Open-ended question only when no issue was reported earlier.\", \"type\": \"text\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"optional\": true, \"capturedAt\": \"n_reuse_reason\"}, \"issue_already_reported\": {\"note\": \"MUST be set true the first time the customer describes ANY issue (at any step, incl. inside the rating/reuse answer), together with experience_issue_detail and issue_topic. When true, the open-ended reason questions are replaced by a single confirmation question.\", \"type\": \"boolean\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"optional\": true}, \"experience_issue_detail\": {\"note\": \"Captured ONCE at first mention of any issue (even inside another answer). Reused as rating_low_reason / reuse_decline_reason when the customer confirms it is the same reason.\", \"type\": \"text\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"optional\": true, \"capturedAt\": \"n_experience_issue\"}, \"closure_experience_sentiment\": {\"type\": \"enum\", \"source\": \"runtime\", \"values\": [\"positive\", \"negative\"], \"capturedAt\": \"n_experience\"}}, \"_testPayloadNote\": \"loan_account_number, branch_code, closure_date are TEST placeholders - map real CRM values per lead. overdue_amount removed (loan is closed).\", \"dispositionCodes\": [{\"code\": \"survey_completed\", \"label\": \"Full survey completed\"}, {\"code\": \"partial_survey_query_exit\", \"label\": \"Customer left after query resolution, survey partially completed\"}, {\"code\": \"wrong_number\", \"label\": \"Wrong person / wrong number\"}, {\"code\": \"requested_callback\", \"label\": \"Customer requested a different time\"}, {\"code\": \"opted_out\", \"label\": \"Customer declined to continue / declined recording consent / explicitly asked to end call\"}, {\"code\": \"escalated_to_agent\", \"label\": \"Handed over to live support during query handling\"}, {\"code\": \"negative_feedback_flagged\", \"label\": \"Survey completed with a negative experience, low rating, or reuse decline captured -- route for follow-up\"}, {\"code\": \"no_answer\", \"label\": \"Call not answered\"}, {\"code\": \"busy\", \"label\": \"Line busy\"}, {\"code\": \"call_dropped\", \"label\": \"Call disconnected mid-conversation\"}, {\"code\": \"dnd_registered\", \"label\": \"Number is on DND registry\"}], \"dispositionRules\": [{\"code\": \"negative_feedback_flagged\", \"when\": \"closure_experience_sentiment == negative OR (service_rating != null AND service_rating <= 2) OR reuse_intent == \\\"no\\\"\", \"overrides\": \"survey_completed\"}, {\"code\": \"partial_survey_query_exit\", \"when\": \"customer leaves after a query is resolved before all survey questions are captured\"}, {\"code\": \"opted_out\", \"when\": \"declined_recording OR explicit end-call request OR refuses any callback\"}], \"loan_account_number\": \"TEST_LOAN_0001\"}',NULL,'generic','active','2026-09-21 15:52:44','2026-09-21 22:16:15','usr_dbd0c45cc799','usr_18f5619e1806',0,NULL,NULL),('rcs_628b06cd7173','tn_ae9d817e8fed','bot_fce3e641b1da','Customer details','api','api_125ebdb9aee7',NULL,'[{\"key\": \"name\", \"type\": \"string\"}, {\"key\": \"amount_due\", \"type\": \"number\", \"sensitive\": true}]',1,'{\"name\": \"Asha\", \"amount_due\": 1200}',NULL,'generic','active','2026-08-25 20:49:06','2026-08-25 20:49:06','usr_c9eb4f926313',NULL,0,NULL,NULL),('rcs_6f9284eb5677','tn_c5a290a5e19a','bot_6ce40c703bf3','User details','manual',NULL,NULL,'[]',1,'{\"voice_speaker_name\": \"shubh\"}',NULL,'generic','active','2026-09-21 11:12:33','2026-09-21 11:12:33','usr_dbd0c45cc799',NULL,0,NULL,NULL),('rcs_9b3d4ba47f02','tn_620d5400d462','bot_71194477c0eb','Verified order facts','manual',NULL,NULL,'[]',1,'{\"order_id\": \"7001001\", \"order_items\": \"Mamaearth Vitamin C Face Wash and Mamaearth Onion Hair Oil\", \"cashback_inr\": 0, \"courier_name\": \"Delhivery\", \"delivered_on\": \"recently delivered\", \"discount_inr\": 50, \"order_status\": \"delivered\", \"payment_mode\": \"prepaid\", \"customer_name\": \"Rekha Nair\", \"refund_status\": \"none\", \"return_eligible\": true, \"order_amount_inr\": 698, \"identity_verified\": false, \"return_window_days\": 7}','Never guess an order fact. If a value is not in the context, ask for the order ID or registered mobile number so the order can be look