Fee related deduction, and RTO issues. Identifies the partner\'s concern (or accepts it directly from the opening utterance), collects exactly that concern\'s scripted enquiry answers, registers a support ticket, and assures a callback from the support team. Built from the four approved call-flow scripts in tenant/zepto/.','archived','v0.1.0','v0.1.0','usr_551d87f85515','neutral',0,0.0000,0,'vp-sv-kavya','2026-08-31 11:56:26','2026-08-31 17:19:29','2026-09-01 12:39:26','usr_551d87f85515','usr_9b626787e757',1,'2026-09-01 07:09:32','usr_1aadc023e041','tn_04250683f1b3',NULL),('bot_33fa43aa0668','Health Care Today','Triage & routing','','published','v0.1.0','v0.1.0',NULL,'neutral',0,0.0000,0,'vp-sv-shubh','2026-09-01 10:12:16','2026-09-01 13:36:59','2026-09-01 15:42:11','usr_dbd0c45cc799','usr_5878e980eed3',0,NULL,NULL,'tn_73ce3e10cf60',NULL),('bot_39db9985b7d5','mPokket Collections – DPD 60-210+ (Recovery)','Outbound collections — DPD 60-210+ recovery & write-off warning calls','Outbound Hinglish collections voice bot for mPokket loans overdue 60-210+ days, built from the \'60-Above 210 Call Flow\' sheet of Call_Script_from.xlsx. Ladder: pay-now push → history & promise → arrange funds → accumulated penalty → CIBIL → limit block → recovery notice → field-visit warning → write-off warning (90+/110+ DPD) → MOP confirmation. Dialer variables: customer_name, agent_name, outstanding_amount, overdue_days, last_payment_date, on_time_repayment_count, dpd_bucket','published','v0.1.0','v0.1.0','usr_48f09517dcda','neutral',0,0.0000,0,'vp-sv-aditya','2026-07-27 12:01:35','2026-07-27 17:31:32','2026-07-27 17:31:34','usr_48f09517dcda','usr_48f09517dcda',0,NULL,NULL,'tn_22a809aecf66',NULL),('bot_447e68933074','Live Channels 30795358','x','','archived','v0.1.0',NULL,'usr-demo-priya','neutral',0,0.0000,0,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-20 12:57:48','2026-07-20 12:57:49','usr-demo-priya',NULL,1,'2026-07-20 07:27:49','usr-demo-priya','tn-001',NULL),('bot_47e52822c803','mPokket Repayment Support (POC)','Inbound loan-repayment & collections support','Inbound customer-support POC for mPokket borrowers: overdue-loan queries, UPI/Debit Card payment guidance, penalty/CIBIL/recovery-notice questions, payment commitments and human escalation. Conversation design derived from the approved mPokket collections call script.','archived','v0.1.0','v0.1.0','usr_c22173241fc4','neutral',0,0.0000,0,'vp-sv-aditya','2026-07-24 07:06:57','2026-07-24 11:41:51','2026-07-27 17:36:34','usr_c22173241fc4','usr_dbd0c45cc799',1,'2026-07-27 12:06:34','usr_48f09517dcda','tn_22a809aecf66',NULL),('bot_4b8d6fe95cb1','Zepto OB Fee Deduction Verification (Outbound)','Outbound onboarding-fee deduction ticket verification','OUTBOUND verification call for Zepto delivery partners who already raised a ticket about an onboarding fee (OB fee) deduction from their payout. Gives the ticket context up front, then verifies conditionally: was the deduction explained at onboarding, was the amount communicated, does the deducted amount match — extracting several answers from one utterance, skipping answered questions, explaining the onboarding fee (document facts only) when it was not explained, recording a not-communicated amount or a discrepancy without inventing a resolution, reading the answers back for confirmation/correction, and registering the structured result on the ticket. Source: Zepto \'OB Deduction BOT\' document. Hindi primary; en-IN + voice configuration copied from bot_59a84478f155.','published','v0.1.0','v0.1.0','usr_9b626787e757','neutral',0,0.0000,0,'vp-sv-kavya','2026-09-10 11:15:21','2026-09-14 10:14:33','2026-09-14 10:14:33','usr_1aadc023e041',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'tn_04250683f1b3',NULL),('bot_517e3d6623ca','Clone Source 6b61e4c1ac','Billing support','The template bot','published','v2.3.0','v2.3.0','usr_03c439732f6f','healthy',71.5,0.0000,4.4,NULL,'2026-08-01 12:00:00','2026-08-25 20:49:25','2026-08-25 20:49:25',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'tn_0a0fa50531d3',NULL),('bot_534f42b2aba5','ZZ Workflow U