\", \"घर renovate\"], \"online_gold_loan\": [\"online gold loan\", \"ogl\", \"online gold loan kaise\", \"ओजीएल\", \"ऑनलाइन गोल्ड लोन\"], \"business_associate\": [\"business associate\", \"ba\", \"referral\", \"बिजनेस एसोसिएट\"], \"redemption_release\": [\"gold release\", \"gold redemption\", \"loan release\", \"sona chhudana\", \"gold chhudana\", \"रिडेम्पशन\", \"गोल्ड रिलीज\"], \"forex_money_transfer\": [\"forex\", \"foreign currency\", \"money transfer\", \"remittance\", \"विदेशी मुद्रा\", \"मनी ट्रांसफर\"], \"balance_transfer_topup\": [\"balance transfer\", \"loan transfer\", \"top up\", \"top-up\", \"बैलेंस ट्रांसफर\", \"टॉप अप\"], \"interest_repayment_renewal\": [\"interest\", \"repayment\", \"emi\", \"renewal\", \"interest rate\", \"किस्त\", \"ब्याज\", \"renewal\"]}, \"matchCanonicalValues\": false}, \"question\": \"जी, बताइए आपको किस चीज़ में सहायता चाहिए?\", \"variable\": \"customer_intent\", \"noInputTimeoutMs\": 6000, \"noInputRepromptLimit\": 1, \"waitForGenerationBeforeTimeout\": true}}, {\"x\": 820, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_kb_answer\", \"kind\": \"message\", \"label\": \"Answer from MAFIL Knowledge Base\", \"config\": {\"message\": \"{kb_answer}\", \"instructions\": \"Answer the customer\'s query using only the approved Manappuram Finance Knowledge Base. If customer_intent already identifies a specific product or category (gold_loan, online_gold_loan, igl, business_loan, home_improvement, housing_loan, property_loan, balance_transfer_topup, forex_money_transfer, makash, interest_repayment_renewal, redemption_release, demat, business_associate, complaint), give the standard KB overview for that product directly in this same turn -- never ask the customer what they want to know, since the intent is already known. Preserve qualifications such as \'up to\', \'starts from\', and \'subject to eligibility\'. Never invent rates, amounts, eligibility, timelines or approval status. Never end the message on a bare acknowledgment alone (\'जी बिल्कुल\', \'जी समझ गया\') with no content after it -- always follow it immediately with the KB answer. Close every response with a short, specific follow-up prompt relevant to the product just discussed (e.g. \'interest rate ya eligibility ke baare mein jaanna chahenge?\'), not a generic filler. Keep the response natural, concise and in Hindi/Hinglish or English mirroring the customer\'s language.\"}}, {\"x\": 1080, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_more\", \"kind\": \"ask\", \"label\": \"Check for another query\", \"config\": {\"entity\": {\"dataType\": \"text\", \"synonyms\": {\"no\": [\"nahi\", \"no\", \"bas\", \"that\'s all\", \"नहीं\", \"बस\", \"और कुछ नहीं\"], \"yes\": [\"haan\", \"yes\", \"ji\", \"haan ji\", \"हाँ\", \"हां\", \"जी\"]}, \"matchCanonicalValues\": false}, \"question\": \"क्या मैं आपकी किसी और चीज़ में भी मदद कर सकता/सकती हूँ?\", \"variable\": \"more_help\", \"noInputTimeoutMs\": 6000, \"waitForGenerationBeforeTimeout\": true}}, {\"x\": 1340, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_close\", \"kind\": \"message\", \"label\": \"Closing\", \"config\": {\"message\": \"जी, ठीक है। Manappuram Finance से संपर्क करने के लिए धन्यवाद। आपका दिन शुभ हो!\"}}, {\"x\": 1600, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_end\", \"kind\": \"end\", \"label\": \"End call\", \"config\": {}}, {\"x\": 560, \"y\": 220, \"id\": \"n_clarify\", \"kind\": \"ask\", \"label\": \"Clarify intent\", \"config\": {\"entity\": {\"dataType\": \"text\", \"synonyms\": {}}, \"question\": \"जी, एक बार बता दीजिए कि आपको किस service या loan के बारे में जानकारी चाहिए?\", \"variable\": \"clarified_intent\", \"noInputTimeoutMs\": 6000, \"waitForGenerationBeforeTimeout\": true}}, {\"x\": 820, \"y\": 220, \"id\": \"n_human\", \"kind\": \"handover\", \"label\": \"Transfer to appropriate live support\", \"config\": {\"message\": \"जी, इस मामले में specific assistance की जरूरत है। मैं आपको appropriate support team से connect करने में मदद करता/करती हूँ।\", \"reasonVariable\": \"customer_intent\"}}, {\"x\": 820, \"y\": 400, \"id\": \"n_branch_location\", \"kind\": \"ask\", \"label\": \"Ask branch location\", \"config\": {\"entity\": {\"dataType\": \"text\", \"synonyms\": {}}, \"question\": \"जी। आप किस city या area में branch ढूंढ रहे हैं?\", \"variable\": \"branch_location\", \"noInputTimeoutMs\": 6000, \"waitForGenerationBeforeTimeout\": true}}, {\"x\": 1080, \"y\": 400, \"id\": \"n_branch_answer\", \"kind\": \"message\", \"label\": \"Provide branch information\", \"config\": {\"message\": \"{branch_information}\", \"instructions\": \"Use only available MAFIL branch/runtime data. Never invent branch address, hours or service availability. If branch data is not available for the given location, say so clearly rather than leaving the message empty, and offer to connect to a live agent.\"}}]','[{\"id\": \"e1\", \"to\": \"n_greeting\", \"from\": \"n_start\"}, {\"id\": \"e2\", \"to\": \"n_intent\", \"from\": \"n_greeting\"}, {\"id\": \"e3\", \"to\": \"n_kb_answer\", \"from\": \"n_intent\"}, {\"id\": \"e4\", \"to\": \"n_clarify\", \"from\": \"n_intent\"}, {\"id\": \"e5\", \"to\": \"n_human\", \"from\": \"n_intent\"}, {\"id\": \"e6\", \"to\": \"n_branch_location\", \"from\": \"n_intent\"}, {\"id\": \"e7\", \"to\": \"n_branch_answer\", \"from\": \"n_branch_location\"}, {\"id\": \"e8\", \"to\": \"n_more\", \"from\": \"n_branch_answer\"}, {\"id\": \"e9\", \"to\": \"n_more\", \"from\": \"n_kb_answer\"}, {\"id\": \"e10\", \"to\": \"n_kb_answer\", \"from\": \"n_clarify\"}, {\"id\": \"e11\", \"to\": \"n_human\", \"from\": \"n_clarify\"}, {\"id\": \"e12\", \"to\": \"n_intent\", \"from\": \"n_more\"}, {\"id\": \"e13\", \"to\": \"n_close\", \"from\": \"n_more\"}, {\"id\": \"e14\", \"to\": \"n_end\", \"from\": \"n_close\"}]','[]','2026-09-21 11:12:33','2026-09-21 11:12:33','usr_dbd0c45cc799',NULL,0,NULL,NULL),('wf_396e29d68c80','tn_7cccde8f8e9d','bot_63a84a264f07','FAQ & information journey',8,'approved','[{\"x\": 40, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_start\", \"kind\": \"start\", \"label\": \"Not used — this bot is prompt-only\", \"config\": {}}, {\"x\": 