essage\", \"label\": \"Penalty advisory\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"I\'d like to flag one thing: our records show available inventory at your property for these dates. Please note that denying a valid booking despite availability can lead to penalties under your agreement with OYO.\"}}, {\"x\": 40, \"y\": 430, \"id\": \"n_intent_penalty\", \"kind\": \"intent\", \"label\": \"Honor after advisory?\", \"config\": {\"prompt\": \"Considering this, would you be able to honor the booking?\"}}, {\"x\": 300, \"y\": 430, \"id\": \"n_intent_altroom\", \"kind\": \"intent\", \"label\": \"Alternate room?\", \"config\": {\"prompt\": \"I\'m sorry to hear about the maintenance. Do you have any alternate rooms available that could accommodate this booking?\"}}, {\"x\": 560, \"y\": 430, \"id\": \"n_api_pricing\", \"kind\": \"api\", \"label\": \"Property Pricing API\", \"config\": {\"connection\": \"OYO Property Pricing\"}}, {\"x\": 820, \"y\": 430, \"id\": \"n_cond_arr\", \"kind\": \"condition\", \"label\": \"Rate meets ARR?\", \"config\": {\"value\": \"meets\", \"operator\": \"equals\", \"variable\": \"rate_vs_arr\"}}, {\"x\": 1080, \"y\": 430, \"id\": \"n_msg_arr\", \"kind\": \"message\", \"label\": \"ARR pitch\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"I checked our records — this booking actually meets or exceeds your average realized rate over the last seven days. We request you to honor the booking to avoid potential penalties and to ensure a positive guest experience.\"}}, {\"x\": 1340, \"y\": 430, \"id\": \"n_intent_arr\", \"kind\": \"intent\", \"label\": \"Honor at ARR?\", \"config\": {\"prompt\": \"Can we count on you to honor this booking?\"}}, {\"x\": 40, \"y\": 560, \"id\": \"n_msg_comp\", \"kind\": \"message\", \"label\": \"Compensation offer\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"I understand the concern on the rate. To bridge the gap, OYO can add a complimentary compensation amount to this reservation from our side.\"}}, {\"x\": 300, \"y\": 560, \"id\": \"n_intent_comp\", \"kind\": \"intent\", 