d\": \"n2\", \"kind\": \"api\", \"label\": \"Fetch invoice\", \"config\": {\"connectionId\": \"api_b9c45d22c41a\"}}, {\"id\": \"n3\", \"kind\": \"end\", \"label\": \"End call\"}]','[{\"id\": \"e1\", \"to\": \"n2\", \"from\": \"n1\"}, {\"id\": \"e2\", \"to\": \"n3\", \"from\": \"n2\"}]','[]','2026-08-25 20:49:25','2026-08-25 20:49:25',NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL),('wf_856c4a9682d4','tn-001','bot_df5fcc4e076c','x journey',1,'draft','[{\"x\": 40, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n1\", \"kind\": \"start\", \"label\": \"Call starts\"}, {\"x\": 40, \"y\": 150, \"id\": \"n2\", \"kind\": \"message\", \"label\": \"Greeting\"}, {\"x\": 40, \"y\": 260, \"id\": \"n3\", \"kind\": \"end\", \"label\": \"End call\"}]','[{\"id\": \"e1\", \"to\": \"n2\", \"from\": \"n1\"}, {\"id\": \"e2\", \"to\": \"n3\", \"from\": \"n2\"}]','[]','2026-07-20 12:52:59','2026-07-20 12:52:59','usr-demo-priya',NULL,0,NULL,NULL),('wf_86ead1912b71','tn_73ce3e10cf60','bot_33fa43aa0668','Triage & routing journey',4,'approved','[{\"x\": 40, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_start\", \"kind\": \"start\", \"label\": \"Outbound call answered\", \"config\": {}}, {\"x\": 300, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_hub_city_confirm\", \"kind\": \"intent\", \"label\": \"City — confirm from payload\", \"config\": {\"prompt\": \"Ji, aap [city] se baat kar rahe hain?\", \"elseIsAnswer\": true, \"responseMode\": \"llm_grounded\", \"captureVariable\": \"patient_city\", \"responseDirective\": \"This is your FIRST reply on the call — the greeting already introduced Pristyn Care and named the treatment, and the patient has just answered it. Open with at most one short acknowledgement, never re-introduce yourself and never re-announce the treatment. Then ask about the city ONCE, and nothing else. Caller context may carry a field \'city\'. WHEN IT HOLDS A VALUE, ask the patient to confirm that city by name — with city \'Mumbai\', say \'Ji, aap Mumbai se baat kar rahe hain?\'. WHEN IT IS NULL, EMPTY OR MISSING, do not confirm anything: ask openly which city they are in — \'Ji, aap kaun se shehar mein hain?\'. Never speak the bracket, the word \'city\', or the field name, and never mention that we hold a record.\"}}, {\"x\": 560, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_hub_city_ask\", \"kind\": \"intent\", \"label\": \"City — open ask (script 1.1.1.2)\", \"config\": {\"prompt\": \"Achha, aap kaun se shehar se hain?\", \"elseIsAnswer\": true, \"responseMode\": \"llm_grounded\", \"captureVariable\": \"patient_city\", \"responseDirective\": \"The patient has just told you the city we named is not theirs. Do not argue, do not repeat that city, and never mention what our record says. Accept it in one short word and ask openly which city they are in, exactly once. Never name any city yourself in this question.\"}}, {\"x\": 820, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_hub_city_reason\", \"kind\": \"intent\", \"label\": \"City — ask with reason (script 1.1.1.2.2)\", \"config\": {\"prompt\": \"Ji, kripya apne shehar ka naam batayein taaki hum aapko aapke nearest clinic se connect karwa sakein.\", \"elseIsAnswer\": true, \"responseMode\": \"llm_grounded\", \"captureVariable\": \"patient_city\", \"responseDirective\": \"The patient still has not given a city. Give them the reason we need it — so we can connect them to their nearest clinic — and ask once. Never argue, never name a city yourself, and never mention what our record says. This is the final city attempt; the flow closes the call after it.\"}}, {\"x\": 1080, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_api_bd_dial\", \"kind\": \"api\", \"label\": \"Dial BD list (attempt 1)\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"Main aapko is shehar ke clinic se abhi connect karwa rahi hun, kripya line par bane rahein.\", \"connection\": \"Pristyn BD Parallel Dial\", \"responseMode\": \"llm_grounded\", \"responseDirective\": \"Say the connecting line once, as a plain statement, and stop. It never names a city — not the one on record, not the one the patient gave: the words are \'is shehar ke clinic se\'. Never mention what our record says and never compare it with what the patient said. No summary, no doctor name, no goodbye, and never ask permission to transfer.\"}}, {\"x\": 1340, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_api_bd_dial2\", \"kind\": \"api\", \"label\": \"Dial BD list (attempt 2)\", \"config\": {\"connection\": \"Pristyn BD Parallel Dial\"}}, {\"x\": 1600, \"y\": 40, \"id\": \"n_handover_bd\", \"kind\": \"handover\", \"label\": \"Patch to answering BD\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"\", \"queue\": \"pristyn_bd\"}}, {\"x\": 40, \"y\": 170, \"id\": \"n_end_busy\", \"kind\": \"end\", \"label\": \"End (clinic lines busy)\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"Ji, abhi clinic ki lines busy aa rahi hain. Hum aapko agle 15 minute mein call back arrange karwa rahe hain.\", \"responseMode\": \"llm_grounded\", \"responseDirective\": \"Both dial attempts failed — this is system-verified, never say it pre-emptively. Tell the patient the clinic lines are busy right now and that a call back is being arranged within the next fifteen minutes, then end. Never promise a specific time or a named person.\"}}, {\"x\": 300, \"y\": 170, \"id\": \"n_end_polite\", \"kind\": \"end\", \"label\": \"End (not interested)\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"Ji, koi baat nahi. Aapka time dene ke liye dhanyavaad. Jab bhi zaroorat ho, aap humein call kar sakte hain. Apna khyaal rakhiye!\"}}, {\"x\": 560, \"y\": 170, \"id\": \"n_end_no_city\", \"kind\": \"end\", \"label\": \"End (no city given)\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"Ji, koi baat nahi. Hamari team aapse jald hi sampark karegi. Aapka time dene ke liye dhanyavaad!\"}}, {\"x\": 820, \"y\": 170, \"id\": \"n_end_callback\", \"kind\": \"end\", \"label\": \"End (patient asked for a callback)\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"Ji, koi baat nahi. Hum aapko baad mein call kar lenge. Aapka time dene ke liye dhanyavaad!\", \"responseMode\": \"llm_grounded\", \"responseDirective\": \"The patient said they are busy or asked to be called later. Accept it in one short sentence, say the team will call back later, thank them and end. Never press for the city, never promise a specific time or a named person, and never ask a question.\"}}]','[{\"id\": \"e_n_start__n_hub_city_confirm\", \"to\": \"n_hub_city_confirm\", \"from\": \"n_start\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_confirm__n_api_bd_dial__3166\", \"to\": \"n_api_bd_dial\", \"from\": \"n_hub_city_confirm\", \"label\": \"haan/ji haan/haan ji/ji/bilkul/sahi hai/sahi/right/yes/correct/theek hai/wahi/wahin/हाँ/हां/जी हाँ/बिल्कुल/सही है/ठीक है/वहीं/Delhi/New Delhi/Gurgaon/Gurugram/Noida/Faridabad/Ghaziabad/Mumbai/Bombay/Thane/Navi Mumbai/Pune/Bangalore/Bengaluru/Hyderabad/Chennai/Kolkata/Ahmedabad/Surat/Jaipur/Lucknow/Kanpur/Indore/Bhopal/Nagpur/Patna/Chandigarh/Ludhiana/Kochi/Coimbatore/Visakhapatnam/Bhubaneswar/South Delhi/Dwarka/Rohini/Andheri/Borivali/Hadapsar/Whitefield/Salt Lake/दिल्ली/मुंबई/पुणे/बंगलौर/हैदराबाद/चेन्नई/कोलकाता/नोएडा/गुड़गांव/अहमदाबाद/जयपुर/लखनऊ/इंदौर/भोपाल\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_confirm__n_end_polite__7140\", \"to\": \"n_end_polite\", \"from\": \"n_hub_city_confirm\", \"label\": \"maine enquiry nahi ki/mujhe interest nahi hai/interest nahi/nahi chahiye/mujhe nahi chahiye/galat number/kisi aur ka number/abhi nahi/call na karein/remove my number/not interested/wrong number/मैंने एन्क्वायरी नहीं की/मुझे इंटरेस्ट नहीं है/नहीं चाहिए/गलत नंबर/कॉल न करें\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_confirm__n_hub_city_ask__4806\", \"to\": \"n_hub_city_ask\", \"from\": \"n_hub_city_confirm\", \"label\": \"nahi/nahin/galat/galat hai/main wahan se nahi hun/aisa nahi hai/no/wrong/not from there/main kyun bataun/aapko kyun bataun/batana zaroori hai/aapko isse kya/नहीं/गलत/मैं वहां से नहीं हूं/मैं क्यों बताऊं/आपको क्यों बताऊं/बताना ज़रूरी है\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_confirm__n_api_bd_dial__2751\", \"to\": \"n_api_bd_dial\", \"from\": \"n_hub_city_confirm\", \"label\": \"agent/customer care/supervisor/manager/human/representative/insaan se/aadmi se/एजेंट/कस्टमर केयर/इंसान से/आदमी से/सुपरवाइज़र/मैनेजर\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_confirm__n_end_callback__6370\", \"to\": \"n_end_callback\", \"from\": \"n_hub_city_confirm\", \"label\": \"call back/call me later/baad mein call karo/baad mein/busy/meeting/kal call karna/shaam ko call karna/time chahiye/बाद में/व्यस्त/मीटिंग/कल कॉल करना/शाम को कॉल करना/समय चाहिए\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_confirm__n_api_bd_dial__7923\", \"to\": \"n_api_bd_dial\", \"from\": \"n_hub_city_confirm\", \"label\": \"else\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_ask__n_api_bd_dial__1758\", \"to\": \"n_api_bd_dial\", \"from\": \"n_hub_city_ask\", \"label\": \"Delhi/New Delhi/Gurgaon/Gurugram/Noida/Faridabad/Ghaziabad/Mumbai/Bombay/Thane/Navi Mumbai/Pune/Bangalore/Bengaluru/Hyderabad/Chennai/Kolkata/Ahmedabad/Surat/Jaipur/Lucknow/Kanpur/Indore/Bhopal/Nagpur/Patna/Chandigarh/Ludhiana/Kochi/Coimbatore/Visakhapatnam/Bhubaneswar/South Delhi/Dwarka/Rohini/Andheri/Borivali/Hadapsar/Whitefield/Salt Lake/दिल्ली/मुंबई/पुणे/बंगलौर/हैदराबाद/चेन्नई/कोलकाता/नोएडा/गुड़गांव/अहमदाबाद/जयपुर/लखनऊ/इंदौर/भोपाल\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_ask__n_hub_city_reason__8990\", \"to\": \"n_hub_city_reason\", \"from\": \"n_hub_city_ask\", \"label\": \"nahi bataunga/nahi bataungi/nahi batana/nahi bata sakta/main kyun bataun/aapko kyun bataun/batana zaroori hai/aapko isse kya/rehne do/chhodo/nahi/nahin/no/none of your business/aap sun nahi rahe/baar baar/wahi baat/नहीं बताऊंगा/नहीं बताना/मैं क्यों बताऊं/रहने दो/नहीं/बार बार/वही बात\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_ask__n_api_bd_dial__6379\", \"to\": \"n_api_bd_dial\", \"from\": \"n_hub_city_ask\", \"label\": \"agent/customer care/supervisor/manager/human/representative/insaan se/aadmi se/एजेंट/कस्टमर केयर/इंसान से/आदमी से/सुपरवाइज़र/मैनेजर\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_ask__n_end_callback__5031\", \"to\": \"n_end_callback\", \"from\": \"n_hub_city_ask\", \"label\": \"call back/call me later/baad mein call karo/baad mein/busy/meeting/kal call karna/shaam ko call karna/time chahiye/बाद में/व्यस्त/मीटिंग/कल कॉल करना/शाम को कॉल करना/समय चाहिए\"}, {\"id\": \"e_n_hub_city_ask__n_api_bd_dial__6584\", \"to\": \"n_api_bd_dial\", \