uman Agent\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"Main aapko abhi humari team se connect kar raha hoon.\"}}, {\"x\": 700, \"y\": 220, \"id\": \"n_not_supported\", \"kind\": \"message\", \"label\": \"Not Tally/Busy - Close\", \"config\": {\"text\": \"Ji, Filhaal yeh software Tally aur Busy users ke saath best work karta hai. Aapka time dene ke liye dhanyawaad. Have a great day!\", \"responseMode\": \"llm_grounded\", \"responseDirective\": \"Reply in the SAME language the customer is speaking - English for an English customer, Hinglish for a Hindi, Hinglish or mixed customer. Never guess the customer\'s gender, and never use Sir alone or Ma\'am alone; the neutral form Sir/Ma\'am is used only where the node\'s own script already has it. Write product names in normal case - Tally, Busy - never in capitals, because capitals are read aloud as shouting. Deliver the approved closing: CredFlow\'s software currently works best for Tally and Busy users, thank the customer for their time and wish them a good day. Open with a plain polite \'Ji\' exactly as the script does - no Sir, no Ma\'am. This ends the call: ask no question, make no demo offer, offer no alternative, and add nothing after the good-day wish.\"}}, {\"x\": 1020, \"y\": 220, \"id\": \"n_end_not_supported\", \"kind\": \"end\", \"label\": \"End - Not Tally/Busy\", \"config\": {}}, {\"x\": 1340, \"y\": 160, \"id\": \"n_demo_schedule\", \"kind\": \"ask\", \"label\": \"Demo Date (time bhi capture karta hai)\", \"config\": {\"entity\": {\"dataType\": \"text\", \"regexPatterns\": [\"(?is)(?:(?<![\\\\wऀ-ॿ])(?:day\\\\s+after\\\\s+tomorrow|(?:next|this)\\\\s+(?:mon|tues|wednes|thurs|fri|satur|sun)day|kal|parso|parson|aaj|today|tomorrow|(?:mon|tues|wednes|thurs|fri|satur|sun)day|somwar|mangalwar|budhwar|guruwar|shukrawar|shanivar|ravivar|\\\\d{1,2}\\\\s*(?:st|nd|rd|th)?\\\\s*(?:jan(?:uary)?|feb(?:ruary)?|mar(?:ch)?|apr(?:il)?|may|jun(?:e)?|jul(?:y)?|aug(?:ust)?|sep(?:t(?:ember)?)?|oct(?:ober)?|nov(?:ember)?|dec(?:ember)?)|(?:jan(?:uar